{"title": "Gnoll", "pageid": 4428, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Gnoll", "categories": ["Creatures", "Races", "Non-playable races"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gnoll.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Gnoll.jpg/300px-Gnoll.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Gnoll.jpg/450px-Gnoll.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Gnoll.jpg/600px-Gnoll.jpg.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Gnoll.jpg/300px-Gnoll.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"182\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Gnoll.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption><div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">  A Gnoll standing over their human victim  </div></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Gnolls</b> are non-playable <a href=\"/wiki/Humanoid\" title=\"Humanoid\">humanoid</a> creatures in <i><a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a></i>. They closely resemble <a href=\"/wiki/Hyena\" title=\"Hyena\">hyenas</a> and are consumed with a primal bloodlust and hunger. Oftentimes, gnolls worship the demon lord <a href=\"/wiki/Yeenoghu\" title=\"Yeenoghu\">Yeenoghu</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 100px; height: 100px; clip-path: xywh(0 0 100% 100% round 15%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/93/Portrait_Gnoll.png/100px-Portrait_Gnoll.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/93/Portrait_Gnoll.png/150px-Portrait_Gnoll.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/93/Portrait_Gnoll.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/93/Portrait_Gnoll.png/100px-Portrait_Gnoll.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/93/Portrait_Gnoll.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Feral, hyena-like humanoids that slaughter indiscriminately in an attempt to quell the insatiable hunger of their demonic creator, Yeenoghu.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— In-game racial description</div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"About_gnolls\">About gnolls</span></h2>\n<p>Gnolls are a race of carnivorous humanoids, tall and lean with a craving for the hunt. They have a strong affinity for family and blood ties, though this comradery is not always extended to separate packs. Gnolls are fond of hyenas, viewing them as brethren and keeping them as pets or hunting companions. Gnolls can be born from <a href=\"/wiki/Bloated_Hyena\" title=\"Bloated Hyena\">bloated hyenas</a> that are fat off the spoils of a massacre.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Flinds\">Flinds</span></h3>\n<p>Flinds are a stronger and more vicious cousin to gnolls who have become part <a href=\"/wiki/Fiend\" title=\"Fiend\">fiend</a>. They often command war bands of gnolls but are otherwise solitary hunters. A gnoll who vanquishes a flind is said to transform into a flind themselves; however, <i>Baldur's Gate 3</i> has no such mechanic.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Racial_features\">Racial features</span></h3>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png/25px-Creature_Speed_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png/38px-Creature_Speed_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Creature Speed Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png/25px-Creature_Speed_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Base Racial Speed</dt>\n<dd>9m / 30ft</dd>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/25px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/38px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Creature Size Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/25px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Size</dt>\n<dd>Medium</dd></dl>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/40px-Darkvision_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/60px-Darkvision_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/80px-Darkvision_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkvision\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/40px-Darkvision_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\">Darkvision</a></span></dt><dd>Can see in the dark up to 12 m (40 ft).</dd></dl>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rampage\" title=\"Rampage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rampage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Rampage\" title=\"Rampage\">Rampage</a></span></dt><dd>When a <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Gnoll</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Downs\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\">Downs</a> a creature with a melee attack, the gnoll can use a <a href=\"/wiki/Bonus_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Action\">Bonus Action</a> to move up to half its <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a> and make a bite attack.</dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gnoll_characters\">Gnoll characters</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%27Barnabus%27\" title=\"'Barnabus'\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/Portrait_%27Barnabus%27.png/30px-Portrait_%27Barnabus%27.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/96/Portrait_%27Barnabus%27.png/45px-Portrait_%27Barnabus%27.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/96/Portrait_%27Barnabus%27.png/60px-Portrait_%27Barnabus%27.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"'Barnabus'\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/Portrait_%27Barnabus%27.png/30px-Portrait_%27Barnabus%27.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/96/Portrait_%27Barnabus%27.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/%27Barnabus%27\" title=\"'Barnabus'\">'Barnabus'</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flind\" title=\"Flind\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Flind.png/30px-Portrait_Flind.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Flind.png/45px-Portrait_Flind.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Flind.png/60px-Portrait_Flind.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flind\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Flind.png/30px-Portrait_Flind.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Portrait_Flind.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flind\" title=\"Flind\">Flind</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%27Timothy%27\" title=\"'Timothy'\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Portrait_%27Timothy%27.png/30px-Portrait_%27Timothy%27.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Portrait_%27Timothy%27.png/45px-Portrait_%27Timothy%27.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Portrait_%27Timothy%27.png/60px-Portrait_%27Timothy%27.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"'Timothy'\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Portrait_%27Timothy%27.png/30px-Portrait_%27Timothy%27.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Portrait_%27Timothy%27.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/%27Timothy%27\" title=\"'Timothy'\">'Timothy'</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%27Tomelia%27\" title=\"'Tomelia'\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_%27Tomelia%27.png/30px-Portrait_%27Tomelia%27.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_%27Tomelia%27.png/45px-Portrait_%27Tomelia%27.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_%27Tomelia%27.png/60px-Portrait_%27Tomelia%27.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"'Tomelia'\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_%27Tomelia%27.png/30px-Portrait_%27Tomelia%27.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d9/Portrait_%27Tomelia%27.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/%27Tomelia%27\" title=\"'Tomelia'\">'Tomelia'</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gnoll_enemy_variants\">Gnoll enemy variants</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gnoll_Fang_of_Yeenoghu\" title=\"Gnoll Fang of Yeenoghu\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Portrait_Gnoll_Fang_of_Yeenoghu.png/30px-Portrait_Gnoll_Fang_of_Yeenoghu.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Portrait_Gnoll_Fang_of_Yeenoghu.png/45px-Portrait_Gnoll_Fang_of_Yeenoghu.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Portrait_Gnoll_Fang_of_Yeenoghu.png/60px-Portrait_Gnoll_Fang_of_Yeenoghu.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gnoll Fang of Yeenoghu\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Portrait_Gnoll_Fang_of_Yeenoghu.png/30px-Portrait_Gnoll_Fang_of_Yeenoghu.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Portrait_Gnoll_Fang_of_Yeenoghu.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gnoll_Fang_of_Yeenoghu\" title=\"Gnoll Fang of Yeenoghu\">Gnoll Fang of Yeenoghu</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gnoll_Flesh_Gnawer\" title=\"Gnoll Flesh Gnawer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Portrait_Gnoll_Flesh_Gnawer_1.png/30px-Portrait_Gnoll_Flesh_Gnawer_1.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Portrait_Gnoll_Flesh_Gnawer_1.png/45px-Portrait_Gnoll_Flesh_Gnawer_1.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Portrait_Gnoll_Flesh_Gnawer_1.png/60px-Portrait_Gnoll_Flesh_Gnawer_1.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gnoll Flesh Gnawer\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Portrait_Gnoll_Flesh_Gnawer_1.png/30px-Portrait_Gnoll_Flesh_Gnawer_1.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/06/Portrait_Gnoll_Flesh_Gnawer_1.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gnoll_Flesh_Gnawer\" title=\"Gnoll Flesh Gnawer\">Gnoll Flesh Gnawer</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gnoll_Hunter\" title=\"Gnoll Hunter\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_Gnoll_Hunter_1.png/30px-Portrait_Gnoll_Hunter_1.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_Gnoll_Hunter_1.png/45px-Portrait_Gnoll_Hunter_1.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_Gnoll_Hunter_1.png/60px-Portrait_Gnoll_Hunter_1.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gnoll Hunter\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_Gnoll_Hunter_1.png/30px-Portrait_Gnoll_Hunter_1.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Portrait_Gnoll_Hunter_1.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gnoll_Hunter\" title=\"Gnoll Hunter\">Gnoll Hunter</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Newborn_Gnoll\" title=\"Newborn Gnoll\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Newborn_Gnoll.png/30px-Portrait_Newborn_Gnoll.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Newborn_Gnoll.png/45px-Portrait_Newborn_Gnoll.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Newborn_Gnoll.png/60px-Portrait_Newborn_Gnoll.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Newborn Gnoll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Newborn_Gnoll.png/30px-Portrait_Newborn_Gnoll.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Portrait_Newborn_Gnoll.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Newborn_Gnoll\" title=\"Newborn Gnoll\">Newborn Gnoll</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 388px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 386px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Nikolai-chugunov-gnoll-nikolai-chugunov-tex-04.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Render by Nikolai Chugunov\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Nikolai-chugunov-gnoll-nikolai-chugunov-tex-04.jpg/579px-Nikolai-chugunov-gnoll-nikolai-chugunov-tex-04.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Nikolai-chugunov-gnoll-nikolai-chugunov-tex-04.jpg/868px-Nikolai-chugunov-gnoll-nikolai-chugunov-tex-04.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Nikolai-chugunov-gnoll-nikolai-chugunov-tex-04.jpg/1158px-Nikolai-chugunov-gnoll-nikolai-chugunov-tex-04.jpg.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Render by Nikolai Chugunov\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Nikolai-chugunov-gnoll-nikolai-chugunov-tex-04.jpg/579px-Nikolai-chugunov-gnoll-nikolai-chugunov-tex-04.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"386\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Nikolai-chugunov-gnoll-nikolai-chugunov-tex-04.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Render by Nikolai Chugunov</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<div class=\"notebegin\">\n<ul><li>Prior to Patch 6, gnolls were categorized as <a href=\"/wiki/Monstrosity\" title=\"Monstrosity\">monstrosities</a> rather than <a href=\"/wiki/Humanoid\" title=\"Humanoid\">humanoids</a>. This change makes <i><a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a></i> more similar to 5th Edition D&amp;D (which also categorizes gnolls as humanoids).</li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Flind\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Ic